  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Information for Development Program (InfoDev)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the Trust Fund are to promote competitiveness, employment and sustainable, inclusive growth in the mobile, climate technology and agro-processing sectors by (a) testing new approaches that enable the growth of innovative new ventures; (b) creating and disseminating knowledge; and c) strengthening recipients&#x2019; capacity to design and implement programs that enable the growth of innovative new ventures.</narrative>
  </description>
